# Changelog

## 0.4.0 (Unreleased)

* Require Go 1.26 or later and update dependencies to current upstream releases.
* Migrate logging to the standard library's structured logger and Prometheus promslog.
  Log records use slog field names (`time`, `level`, `source`, and `msg`).
* Modernize module-based builds, container images, and Linux amd64/arm64 CI validation.
* Cancel polling before releasing USB resources, handle initialization failures,
  and reject short sensor packets before decoding.
* Add English maintenance guidelines in AGENTS.md and document source-build prerequisites.
* Suppress harmless USB event-loop `interrupted [code -10]` log messages by
  upgrading gousb from v1.1.0 to v1.1.3. This addresses [issue #3](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/3)
  through the [upstream fix](https://github.com/google/gousb/commit/2f9ed92cb863c87f7bb5fa58a54c6502ef0a5e1f).
  This change suppresses a misleading event-loop message; it does not suppress
  errors returned by sensor reads.
* Add regression coverage for plaintext and encrypted sensor packets, preserving
  the [issue #2](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/2) fix already included in 0.3.0.

### Historical issue verification (2026-10-11)

* [Issue #1](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/1): the published Docker `latest`
  image, reporting version 0.3.0, and the local 0.4.0 test image both successfully
  ran `--version` on Linux amd64. The reported glibc/musl relocation error was not reproduced.
* [Issue #2](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/2): the merged plaintext-packet
  fix is present in the local branch. Plaintext and encrypted packet decoding
  tests pass with the race detector. Real-device readings have not been verified.
* [Issue #3](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/3): the published 0.3.0 binary
  still uses gousb v1.1.0, which logs interrupted event-loop calls as errors.
  The 0.4.0 dependency includes the upstream suppression. Source inspection
  confirms the change; a real-device reproduction has not been performed.

## 0.3.0

* Add support for AIRCO2NTROL COACH.
* Add support for CO2Meter RAD-0301.
* Fix the glibc/musl mismatch by building the Docker binary on Alpine.
  ([Issue #1](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/1))
* Skip decryption when a sensor packet already contains the plaintext marker
  `0x0d`, correcting zero readings from newer CO2Meter devices.
  ([Issue #2](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/issues/2), [PR #5](https://github.com/huhamhire/air-co2-exporter/pull/5))

## 0.2.0

* Ported from node.js project.
